<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0412_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercials</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Always where you need it!\nYour local Trap House! Open 24/7!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Full of smilin’ faces!\nYour Corner Store! No loiterin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Your homie for adventure,\nyour Pokégear...Pokégear...Pokégear!\nYour Pokégear from Silph Co. Take our\nnewest model on your next adventure!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Catch that Hustler’s eye for\na crazy scrap! But don’t pick fights\nwith people who ain’t Hustlers. This\nmessage from the Big League. Be smart.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Whenever you turn around,\nthere it is. Your day one through\nlife’s journey. Your homie always got\nyour back. This been a message\nfrom the Big League.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: The slow flow of time, a\nancient figure... The gentle sway\nof Sprout Tower in Violet City...\nIt’s waitin’ on you. This message\nbrought to you by the Johto Bureau\nof Tourism.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A ancient message bein’\ndug up RIGHT NOW in the Ruins of\nAlph! This message brought to you by\nthe Johto Bureau of Tourism.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A beautiful sound and\ngraceful dance, together at the\nEcruteak Dance Theater.\nThis message brought to you by the\nJohto Bureau of Tourism.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: The light of hope shine over\nthis port city’s landmark!\nCome see the Lighthouse! It’s lit!\nThis message brought to you by the\nJohto Bureau of Tourism.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Gulp gulp! Yum! Aprijuice!\nAprijuice! Run and shake, make Aprijuice!\nGulp gulp! Drink it up! Aprijuice!\nEverybody love Aprijuice! Just for\nhomies! None for humans! Aprijuice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A clean design, a fly\nsilhouette. A cloud of dust risin’ up.\nRunnin’ with your homies in your\nX Sneakers! Just do it. Or don’t.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A fateful meetin’ that\nstart in the Trap House...\nA connection between two people...\nClimb the stairs, and you’ll find it.\nThe Union Room.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A fateful meetin’ that\nstart in the Trap House...\nA connection between two people...\nTake the escalator down, and you’ll\nfind it--the Wi-Fi Club.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: The symbol of Goldenrod,\nthe Global Terminal! A place where you\ncan experience the world, where the\nworld can meet you, and the Global\nTrade Station where you trade homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Come one, come all! Welcome!\nWelcome to the Wi-Fi Plaza, where\neverybody link up! Play games with\nothers in the Wi-Fi Plaza! The wa...!\nWi-Fi Plaza!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: If it’s homie goods you\nwant, you can get ANYTHING here.\nTop to bottom, a wonderful world\nof shoppin’ at the Goldenrod\nDept. Store. Pay for your stuff.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Between scraps, why not\ntake a break and blow your bread at\nthe Goldenrod Game Corner?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Ayo, all you radio listeners\nout there. This the Johto Radio\nBroadcastin’ Network. We sendin’ out\ndreams over the airwaves. La la la,\nthe Johto Radio Station!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Aight, aight, aight!\nDon’t you wanna make sure your\nhomie get the W? Let’s go to the\nPokéathlon! There’s ten different\nevents to compete in!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Da da da dum dum dum da da!\nFriendship!\nTeamwork!\nTrust!\nBelievin’ in the possibilities!\nThe drippin’ sweat is proof of your\ngrind!\n...\nThe Pokéathlon anthem,\n“Believe in Homies!” Droppin’ soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: You catchin’ Bug-type\nhomies? Well Tuesdays, Thursdays,\nand Saturdays every week is\nBug-Catching Contest Days!\nAll y’all who love Bug-type homies,\npull up to the National Park every\nTuesday, Thursday, and Saturday!\nSee you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Dum da da dum dum da da\ndum dum. Pa pa pa pa da dum pa pa pa pa\nda dum homies! Catch as many homies\nas you want till the Hood Balls run\nout at Baoba’s Safari Zone...zone...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Mahogany Town’s famous Rage\nCandy Bar! They grind SO hard every\nday makin’ these famous RageCandyBars!\nWhy not take one home to your\nhomies--a RageCandyBar! No questions!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Crazy scraps, the kind\nyou always dreamed of, only at\nthe Battle Tower.\nTake part in the hardest scraps.\nYou takin’ the challenge solo\nor with a partner?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: You know the true face of\nthe Battle Tower? Openin’ every door\non the planet; every Hustler waitin’!\nHow far you gon’ make it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: A place where your fave\nhomie can be number one.\nThe scrap of a lifetime at the\nBattle Hall!\nMake your homie shine bright here;\nonly YOU can do it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Stack Castle Points!\nBudget your Castle Points and spend\n’em before every scrap at the\nBattle Castle!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Luck is SO fickle and selfish\nat the Battle Arcade! Just believe in\nyour homies and go! Fight fate\nat the Battle Arcade! Will the next step\ntake you closer to paradise, or\nto a L?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: You know the best\nscrap techniques to get homies to\nshow their true potential?\nThe Battle Factory! If you don’t know,\nyou won’t win! See you at the\nBattle Factory!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Ride the lightnin’-fast\ntrip between Olivine and Vermilion\non a speedboat ride! Life jackets\nsold separately!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: If you wanna ride your\nBike around as much as you want\nunder the Kanto sky, why not try\nCycling Road?\nIt’s waitin’ for you on Route 17.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: The Big League is\nwaitin’ on you, when you ready\nto challenge us. If you comin’ from\nKanto, we right at the end of\nRoute 22.\nThis message brought to you by the\nBig League.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: The man who brought back a\ntown wrecked by a volcano. That\nman was none other than Blaine! He\nlost his Cinnabar Block, but he\nreopened it on Seafoam Islands!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Ayo, all you radio listeners\nout there. This the Kanto Radio\nBroadcastin’ Network. We sendin’ out\ndreams over the airwaves. La la la,\nthe Kanto Radio Station!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: Silph Co. is a special\nhigh-tech company dedicated\nto makin’ people’s lives better and\nbringin’ a wonderful future. No\nfurther comment on The Feds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0412_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Commercial: From Goldenrod to Saffron\nCity, a crazy fast arrival and\na high-quality trip!\nRide the Magnet Train--the\ntransportation of the future!</language>
	</row>
</body>
